OL,3,GNEWSAWest Midlands braces as flooding
OL,4,Aenters third day
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the latest incident, in
OL,7,FWolverhampton, flooding on Church
OL,8,FStreet, Bilston - linked to a burst
OL,9,Fmain - saw the street submerged and the
OL,10,Fnearby indoor market also take on
OL,11,Fwater.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, the Environment Agency (EA)
OL,14,Fhas issued two flood warnings -
OL,15,Fcovering parts of Staffordshire and
OL,16,FWarwickshire - and many more alerts.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
